    <string name="permission_title">Where are you praying?</string>
    <string name="permission_body">SajdaTime needs a rough idea of where you are to work out your prayer times and the direction of the Qibla. Tap the info icon to see exactly what that means.</string>
    <string name="permission_why_title">Why we need your location</string>
    <string name="permission_why_body">To work out the right prayer times and Qibla direction for where you are.\n\nWe only check your approximate location while the app is open. It stays on your phone. We never send it anywhere, and we never track you.</string>
