    <!-- Disclaimer -->
    <string name="disclaimer_title">Please read this first</string>
    <!--
      The dua request lives here, at the end of the one screen every user is shown exactly
      once, and nowhere else. It was briefly a permanent card in About as well; asking
      twice for the same thing is asking too often. This dialog is also reachable any time
      from Settings, so it stays available without ever being repeated unprompted.
      Do not remove the last paragraph.
    -->
    <string name="disclaimer_body">SajdaTime is a helper, not a religious authority.\n\nI am not a Mufti, Aalim, or an expert in fiqh. This app was built with the help of artificial intelligence, and it may get things wrong.\n\nIf a time or a direction looks off, or if you are unsure, please check with your local mosque or someone qualified to advise you.\n\nAnd one request, if you would: please remember me, my family, and my parents in your duas.</string>

