    <!--
      Settings.

      Three groups, and every row below the group heading opens one focused chooser. The
      screen used to lay all twenty-five choices out flat, which meant a new user met four
      radio lists and six switches before reaching About. Each row now shows its current
      answer as its subtitle, so the whole of a user's setup is readable at a glance
      without opening anything.
    -->
